{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"صيغة الالتماس (subjuntivo): coser (خَاطَ)، entrar (أَدْخَلَ، دَخَلَ)، pasar (قَضَى)، deber (يَنْبَغِي أَنْ)، escolar (تِلْمِيذ)، tomar (أَخَذَ)، vestir (لَبِسَ)، contar (عَدَّ)، necesitar (حَاجَة)، dar (أَعْطَى)."},{"btype":"example","text":"coser","note":"yo cosa، tú cosas، él/ella/usted cosa، nosotros cosamos، vosotros cosáis، ellos/ustedes cosan"},{"btype":"example","text":"entrar","note":"yo entre، tú entres، él/ella/usted entre، nosotros entremos، vosotros entréis، ellos/ustedes entren"},{"btype":"example","text":"pasar","note":"yo pase، tú pases، él/ella/usted pase، nosotros pasemos، vosotros paséis، ellos/ustedes pasen"},{"btype":"example","text":"deber","note":"yo deba، tú debas، él/ella/usted deba، nosotros debamos، vosotros debáis، ellos/ustedes deban"}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.conjugate","count":10,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.conjugate","count":10,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.conjugate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"es","lang_name":"الإسبانية","verbs":[{"infinitive":"coser","meaning":"خَاطَ","tense":"صيغة الالتماس (subjuntivo)","forms":{"yo":"cosa","tú":"cosas","él/ella/usted":"cosa","nosotros":"cosamos","vosotros":"cosáis","ellos/ustedes":"cosan"},"difficulty":2},{"infinitive":"entrar","meaning":"أَدْخَلَ، دَخَلَ","tense":"صيغة الالتماس (subjuntivo)","forms":{"yo":"entre","tú":"entres","él/ella/usted":"entre","nosotros":"entremos","vosotros":"entréis","ellos/ustedes":"entren"},"difficulty":2},{"infinitive":"pasar","meaning":"قَضَى","tense":"صيغة الالتماس (subjuntivo)","forms":{"yo":"pase","tú":"pases","él/ella/usted":"pase","nosotros":"pasemos","vosotros":"paséis","ellos/ustedes":"pasen"},"difficulty":2},{"infinitive":"deber","meaning":"يَنْبَغِي أَنْ","tense":"صيغة الالتماس (subjuntivo)","forms":{"yo":"deba","tú":"debas","él/ella/usted":"deba","nosotros":"deb